{"id":"vod_lz_23065","vodId":"23065","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"恶魔高校D×D","name_cn":"恶魔高校D×D","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220615-1/f1afb4e8b7b1b84d0fb105db169789f3.jpg"},"summary":"在校园里，兵藤一诚（尾裕贵 配音）“大色狼”的“美名”广为流传，托它的福，一诚至今任然过着没有女朋友的孤苦生活。这注定是不寻常的一日，首先，一诚居然收到了来自美少女的告白；然后，当一诚正准备开始他梦寐以求的幸福约会时，他被果断的杀死了！当一诚再次睁开眼时，面前的红发女子告诉一诚，是她复活了已经死去的他，并且从今天开始，他将成为她的奴仆。                                                                     　　红发女子名叫莉雅丝（日笠阳子 配音），其真实身份是一名恶魔。袭击一诚的女子隶属“堕天使”的行列，从莉雅丝口中的“战争”和“神器”等艰涩的名词，以及接连不断的，来自于堕天使们的攻击中，一诚知道，自己单纯快乐的校园生活即将画上句点。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-06-15 20:36:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24606_5075600f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24605_66d9fe6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24607_3896c581/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24610_55c0459e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24608_eaae37b7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24609_2724f1ab/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24612_cab9e70f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24611_69177e0a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24613_d6ffcfba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24614_aec59b6c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24615_c6b4f9c3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24616_63a13426/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220614/24617_31dc9198/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"h